00:56:39.080 --> 00:56:46.720
it's this, this giant enemy that's maybe, you know, 20 times the, the sprite size of Mega Man.

00:56:46.900 --> 00:56:57.680
And each little cube 20th sprite, each little, like, portion of his sprite breaks off from him and shoots across the screen one at a time that you have to dodge.

00:56:57.880 --> 00:56:59.980
And that's just in between its attacks.

00:56:59.980 --> 00:57:08.340
So, like, not only are you fighting him, but, like, every couple seconds you have to, like, wait while he transitions to the other side of the screen and avoid all of those, too.

00:57:08.440 --> 00:57:10.200
So, it's like you're in kind of two fights at once.

00:57:10.920 --> 00:57:15.820
All while, and this is gonna, I'm just gonna, like, shove my nitpicks into this section right here.

00:57:15.940 --> 00:57:23.300
All while there is some very questionable hitbox stuff going on, um, and maybe some input eating.

00:57:23.300 --> 00:57:33.280
I don't know how you guys felt about these specific complaints, but I felt like your hitbox against a lot of enemies was larger than your sprite.

00:57:34.000 --> 00:57:43.420
And, uh, I would, like, input to turn around to shoot, and I, it would eat my turn around input, and I'd be shooting in the opposite direction.

00:57:44.060 --> 00:57:45.300
Uh, yeah, that happens.

00:57:45.300 --> 00:57:55.740
So, these are things that happen playing this game, so it's not always your fault when you, when you get hit, and, or, uh, you know, fail to take advantage of an opening.

00:57:56.100 --> 00:57:58.040
And sometimes that, that hurts.

00:57:58.960 --> 00:58:02.320
Yeah, and, and I don't want to say that, like, the Yellow Devil is impossible.

00:58:02.320 --> 00:58:06.720
I just don't think I had the, the time commitment, uh, to make it beyond that.

00:58:06.840 --> 00:58:11.860
Because what's interesting is, the Yellow Devil is pretty early on in Wily's castle, and he's tough.

00:58:12.400 --> 00:58:23.540
After that, you have to fight, uh, these Mega Man holograms, which are also, like, a tough enemy if you don't understand that, like, oh, only one of them is the real Mega Man hologram.

00:58:23.540 --> 00:58:28.820
Which is like, wait, that's not how that works, because I'm the real Mega Man, so why are the, why are there, like, what is this?

00:58:28.900 --> 00:58:33.120
Like, one of them is also the real Mega Man, and the other two are holograms, or are they all three holograms?

00:58:33.400 --> 00:58:44.140
Anyway, that one's a, a, a challenging boss, because they kind of, like, appear from their hologram base, they run to the left, shoot like crazy, all three of them at the same time.

00:58:45.080 --> 00:58:53.520
And, homing at you, uh, all three of them, and then they run to the right, and they shoot some stuff, and then they go back to their hologram base, and, and then you have to, like, oh, I don't know which one.

00:58:53.540 --> 00:58:55.340
