01:00:50.140 --> 01:00:52.280
And like I said, you don't have to fight Dr.

01:00:52.360 --> 01:00:57.300
Wily at the end of this boss rush, so it's not, uh, as challenging as it once was.

01:00:57.840 --> 01:00:59.720
Still padding. Yep, still padding.

01:00:59.880 --> 01:01:00.700
